    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "3.6 使用注意点",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1）Google Trends 展示的不是搜索量，而是搜索量的近似值，可以理解成搜索兴趣"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Google Trends 提供的不是搜索的准确数值，所以应该避免使用「我们的 Google 搜索量增长了 100%」之类的说法"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这只是一个近似值，你可以说「搜索兴趣增长了 100%」"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2）关键词比较功能"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "如果你想比较两个关键词，直接使用 「Add comparison」"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "orig_url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/lCtoVKYbOkialjfYBRHNqeccF3dTtia2MRHpQ6Ded4YCL1uiawGwMvCCj0ovpB0mFibAXK47mrwiaJx3RbIccHjgO0g/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg",
      "alt": "img",
      "src": "assets/img-19.png",
      "key": "19",
      "local": "img-19.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "不要把两个关键词分别都搜索一遍，因为他们的标准化指数不一样，所以这样得到的结果是不准的"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "4、高级功能",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "在上面我们介绍了 Search Topic 和 Search terms ，在我们使用 Google Trends 中使用 Topic 搜索比 terms 搜索相对来说会好一点"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "因为 terms 是精确搜索，Topic 相对来说搜索范围更大"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "但是如果没有符合你搜索条件的 Topic，你可以使用标点符号来准确找到你需要的内容"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "4.1 标点符号",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "如果你搜索 「boat trip」不带任何标点符号，那么搜索结果中，这两个词的顺序就是任意的，结果不会包含任何拼写错误的词、变体以及复数形式"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "orig_url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/lCtoVKYbOkialjfYBRHNqeccF3dTtia2MRbVs2riaggHITwooNj7RwfwGH32LAdkhzC6qRaojzHW2Ozss8xlFFrvw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg",
      "alt": "img",
      "src": "assets/img-20.png",
      "key": "20",
      "local": "img-20.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "我们可以在搜索关键词中使用标点符号，包括"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "引号",
        "加号",
        "减号"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1）引号"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "搜索带引号的 「\"boat trip\"」会显示可能带有前面的单词或者后面的单词"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "orig_url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/lCtoVKYbOkialjfYBRHNqeccF3dTtia2MR05EZUaso1N3ODYacBQIRgrFx6wS0nlsTzCwGqsQ49U5sMst5TEibzsA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg",
      "alt": "img",
      "src": "assets/img-21.png",
      "key": "21",
      "local": "img-21.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2）减号"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "搜索带减号的 「\"boat -trip\"」结果包含单词 boat 不包含单词 trip"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "orig_url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/lCtoVKYbOkialjfYBRHNqeccF3dTtia2MRylib88MFtQToFUicmscWpD3P6Zr3BD7rRzicZjPbfVLIQR4Oia7vYAOXMg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg",
      "alt": "img",
      "src": "assets/img-22.png",
      "key": "22",
      "local": "img-22.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3）加号"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "搜索带加号的 「\"boat +trip\"」结果包含 boat 和 trip"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "orig_url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/lCtoVKYbOkialjfYBRHNqeccF3dTtia2MR9wIyo2kQMLibicFeYgGvibnZGPjnRAv4KopMZ9NdqSTJxXQuanFH9lVGA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg",
      "alt": "img",
      "src": "assets/img-23.png",
      "key": "23",
      "local": "img-23.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "加号的热度始终会高于引号和减号，因为他包含的结果最广泛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "4.2 高级比较模式",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同关键词不同时间维度对比"
    },
